Architecture Principle Statement

Enterprise solutions shall adopt a Headless Architecture approach whereby user experiences are separated from business capabilities through secure, governed, reusable APIs and events, enabling independent evolution of channels, rapid innovation, scalability, resilience, and technology agility while maintaining consistent governance, security, and operational excellence across the enterprise.

This principle is particularly relevant for modern composable enterprises, digital platforms, API ecosystems, AI-driven channels, and omnichannel customer experiences. It aligns strongly with cloud-native, domain-driven, event-driven, and platform engineering architectural strategies.
